,3,"Dili","The Santa Cruz massacre was the murder of at least 250 East Timorese pro-independence demonstrators in the Santa Cruz cemetery in the capital, Dili, on 12 November 1991, during the Indonesian occupation of East Timor and is part of the East Timor genocide.","Santa_Cruz_massacre","1991-11-12",null,null,"Santa Cruz massacre"],["Invention of vanishing gradient problem",48.14,11.57,1991,1991,"sci",3,"Technical University of Munich","In machine learning, the vanishing gradient problem is the problem of greatly diverging gradient magnitudes between earlier and later layers encountered when training neural networks with backpropagation. In such methods, neural network weights are updated proportional to their partial derivative of the loss function. As the number of forward propagation steps in a network increases, for instance due to greater network depth, the gradients of earlier weights are calculated with increasingly many multiplications. These multiplications shrink the gradient magnitude. Consequently…","Vanishing_gradient_problem",null,"Sepp Hochreiter",null,"Invention of vanishing gradient problem"],["1991 World Table Tennis Championships",35.65,140.03,1991,1991,"cul",2,"Makuhari Messe","1991 edition of the World Table Tennis Championships","1991_World_Table_Tennis_Championships","1991-04-24",null,null,"1991 World Table Tennis Championships"],["1991 Allsvenskan",61,15,1991,1991,"cul",2,"","1991 season of Fotbollsallsvenskan","1991_Allsvenskan","1991-04-07",null,null,"1991 Allsvenskan"],["1991 Women's Rugby World Cup",52.35,-3.63,1991,1991,"cul",2,"Wales","1st Women's Rugby World Cup","1991_Women%27s_Rugby_World_Cup","1991-04-06",null,null,"1991 Women's Rugby World Cup"],["1991–92 Slovenian PrvaLiga",46,15,1991,1991,"cul",2,"","football league season","1991%E2%80%9392_Slovenian_PrvaLiga","1991-08-18",null,null,"1991–92 Slovenian PrvaLiga"],["1991 FIVB Volleyball World League",45.47,9.19,1991,1991,"cul",2,"Milan","volleyball competition","1991_FIVB_Volley